SUMMARY:FNECC 20th Anniversary Celebration
DESCRIPTION:This year\, our 20th-anniversary celebration is made even mor
 e special as we host our annual Stomp Dance. Come gather in community\, h
 ear the rhythmic cadence of the songs\, and celebrate the living\, breath
 ing traditions that keep our cultures thriving. Whether you have been a p
 art of the FNECC family since our doors opened or are stepping into our c
 ircle for the very first time\, your presence makes our celebration compl
 ete. Join us for a memorable day of food\, reflection\, song\, and dance.
 For more information\, view this event in BeInvolved (https://beinvolved.
 indiana.edu/event/12819604).
